    description: "Language-parameterized CFG builder (~700-1000 lines Python). BasicBlock, CfgStatement, CfgEdge, FunctionCfg data structures. Fringe-based recursive algorithm (same as Joern CfgCreator). Handles: sequential, if/else, loops, break/continue, return, try/catch, switch/match. Semantic hooks: early_return_on_error (Rust ?), context_manager (Python with), deferred_execution (Go defer). See ADR-0017 §1a."  # d885
